#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:8
msgid "Contents:"
msgstr "목차:"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:2
msgid "CTHarvester Documentation"
msgstr "CTHarvester 문서"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:4
msgid "Welcome to CTHarvester's documentation!"
msgstr "CTHarvester 문서에 오신 것을 환영합니다!"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:6
msgid "CTHarvester is a PyQt5-based application for processing and visualizing CT (Computed Tomography) scan image stacks. It provides tools for thumbnail generation, 3D mesh visualization, and image stack management."
msgstr "CTHarvester는 CT(컴퓨터 단층촬영) 스캔 이미지 스택을 처리하고 시각화하는 PyQt5 기반 애플리케이션입니다. 썸네일 생성, 3D 메시 시각화 및 이미지 스택 관리 도구를 제공합니다."

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:22
msgid "Features"
msgstr "기능"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:24
msgid "**Multi-level Thumbnail Generation**: Automatically generate thumbnail pyramids for fast navigation"
msgstr "**다단계 썸네일 생성**: 빠른 탐색을 위해 썸네일 피라미드를 자동으로 생성합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:25
msgid "**3D Visualization**: Real-time 3D mesh generation using Marching Cubes algorithm"
msgstr "**3D 시각화**: Marching Cubes 알고리즘을 사용한 실시간 3D 메시 생성"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:26
msgid "**High Performance**: Rust-based thumbnail generation with Python fallback (3-10x speedup)"
msgstr "**고성능**: Rust 기반 썸네일 생성과 Python 폴백 (3-10배 속도 향상)"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:27
msgid "**User-Friendly**: Modern UI with 24 keyboard shortcuts, 100% tooltip coverage, and professional 8px grid layout"
msgstr "**사용자 친화적**: 키보드 단축키 24개, 툴팁 100% 적용, 8px 그리드 기반 레이아웃을 갖춘 현대적인 UI"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:28
msgid "**Flexible Settings**: JSON-based configuration with import/export functionality"
msgstr "**유연한 설정**: 가져오기/내보내기를 지원하는 JSON 기반 설정"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:29
msgid "**Multi-language Support**: English and Korean (한국어) interface"
msgstr "**다국어 지원**: 영어 및 한국어 인터페이스"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:30
#, python-format
msgid "**Robust Testing**: 1,295 tests with ~79% code coverage"
msgstr "**견고한 테스트**: 테스트 1,295개, 코드 커버리지 약 79%"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:31
msgid "**Enhanced Progress Tracking**: ETA calculation, remaining items counter, and cancel functionality"
msgstr "**향상된 진행 상황 추적**: 예상 완료 시간 계산, 남은 항목 수 표시, 취소 기능"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:34
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "빠른 시작"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:37
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "설치"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:52
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr "기본 사용법"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:54
msgid "**Open CT Scan Directory**"
msgstr "**CT 스캔 디렉토리 열기**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:56
msgid "Click \"Open Directory\" to select a folder containing CT scan images. The application will automatically generate multi-level thumbnails for fast navigation."
msgstr "\"디렉토리 열기\"를 클릭하여 CT 스캔 이미지가 포함된 폴더를 선택합니다. 애플리케이션은 빠른 탐색을 위해 다단계 썸네일을 자동으로 생성합니다."

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:59
msgid "**Navigate Through Slices**"
msgstr "**슬라이스 탐색**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:61
msgid "Use the vertical timeline slider to browse through the CT stack. The 2D viewer shows the current slice, while the 3D viewer displays the mesh."
msgstr "수직 타임라인 슬라이더를 사용하여 CT 스택을 탐색합니다. 2D 뷰어는 현재 슬라이스를 표시하고, 3D 뷰어는 메시를 표시합니다."

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:64
msgid "**Set Region of Interest (ROI)**"
msgstr "**관심 영역(ROI) 설정**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:66
msgid "Define the region you want to process by setting the lower and upper bounds:"
msgstr "하한 및 상한을 설정하여 처리할 영역을 정의합니다:"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:68
msgid "**Set Lower Bound**: Click \"Set Bottom\" button or press the keyboard shortcut to mark the bottom slice of your ROI"
msgstr "**하한 설정**: \"하단 설정\" 버튼을 클릭하거나 키보드 단축키를 눌러 ROI의 하단 슬라이스를 표시합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:69
msgid "**Set Upper Bound**: Click \"Set Top\" button or press the keyboard shortcut to mark the top slice of your ROI"
msgstr "**상한 설정**: \"상단 설정\" 버튼을 클릭하거나 키보드 단축키를 눌러 ROI의 상단 슬라이스를 표시합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:70
msgid "The selected region will be highlighted in the timeline slider"
msgstr "선택한 영역이 타임라인 슬라이더에 강조 표시됩니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:71
msgid "You can adjust bounds by moving to a different slice and clicking the buttons again"
msgstr "다른 슬라이스로 이동하여 버튼을 다시 클릭하면 경계를 조정할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:72
msgid "Click \"Reset\" to clear the ROI selection"
msgstr "\"재설정\"을 클릭하여 ROI 선택을 지웁니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:74
msgid "**Adjust Bounding Box (Optional)**"
msgstr "**바운딩 박스 조정 (선택사항)**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:76
msgid "Fine-tune the 2D bounding box around your region of interest:"
msgstr "관심 영역 주변의 2D 바운딩 박스를 미세 조정합니다:"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:78
msgid "The bounding box appears as a red rectangle in the 2D viewer"
msgstr "바운딩 박스는 2D 뷰어에서 빨간색 사각형으로 나타납니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:79
msgid "Drag the corners or edges to resize the box"
msgstr "모서리나 가장자리를 드래그하여 박스 크기를 조정합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:80
msgid "The box defines the X-Y crop boundaries for your export"
msgstr "박스는 내보내기에 대한 X-Y 자르기 경계를 정의합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:81
msgid "Combined with lower/upper bounds, this creates a 3D volume selection"
msgstr "하한/상한과 결합하여 3D 볼륨 선택을 생성합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:83
msgid "**Adjust Visualization**"
msgstr "**시각화 조정**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:85
msgid "Use the **threshold slider** on the right to modify the isovalue for 3D mesh generation"
msgstr "오른쪽의 **임계값 슬라이더**를 사용하여 3D 메시 생성을 위한 등치값을 수정합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:86
msgid "Higher threshold values show denser materials"
msgstr "임계값이 높을수록 밀도가 높은 재료가 표시됩니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:87
msgid "Lower threshold values reveal more internal structures"
msgstr "임계값이 낮을수록 더 많은 내부 구조가 표시됩니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:88
msgid "The 3D mesh updates in real-time as you adjust the threshold"
msgstr "임계값을 조정하면 3D 메시가 실시간으로 업데이트됩니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:90
msgid "**Export Your Data**"
msgstr "**데이터 내보내기**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:92
msgid "Once you've defined your ROI and settings:"
msgstr "ROI 및 설정을 정의한 후:"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:94
msgid "**Save Cropped Image Stack**: Exports only the selected slices within the bounding box"
msgstr "**잘린 이미지 스택 저장**: 바운딩 박스 내에서 선택한 슬라이스만 내보냅니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:95
msgid "**Export 3D Model**: Saves the 3D mesh as OBJ, STL, or PLY format"
msgstr "**3D 모델 내보내기**: 3D 메시를 OBJ, STL 또는 PLY 형식으로 저장합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:96
msgid "The exported data includes only the region defined by your ROI settings"
msgstr "내보낸 데이터에는 ROI 설정에 정의된 영역만 포함됩니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:98
msgid "**Workflow Example**:"
msgstr "**워크플로우 예제**:"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:110
msgid "**Keyboard Shortcuts**:"
msgstr "**키보드 단축키**:"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:112
msgid "``B`` - Set bottom boundary (lower bound)"
msgstr "``B`` - 하단 경계 설정 (하한)"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:113
msgid "``T`` - Set top boundary (upper bound)"
msgstr "``T`` - 상단 경계 설정 (상한)"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:114
msgid "``Ctrl+R`` - Reset ROI selection"
msgstr "``Ctrl+R`` - ROI 선택 재설정"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:115
msgid "``Left/Right`` - Navigate slices"
msgstr "``Left/Right`` - 슬라이스 탐색"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:116
msgid "``Up/Down`` - Adjust threshold"
msgstr "``Up/Down`` - 임계값 조정"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:117
msgid "``Home/End`` - Jump to first/last slice"
msgstr "``Home/End`` - 첫 번째/마지막 슬라이스로 이동"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:118
msgid "``Ctrl+Left/Right`` - Jump 10 slices backward/forward"
msgstr "``Ctrl+Left/Right`` - 10개 슬라이스 뒤로/앞으로 이동"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/index.rst:120
msgid "For more detailed instructions, see the :doc:`user_guide`."
msgstr "자세한 지침은 :doc:`user_guide`를 참조하세요."

